# 64-host, 2-tier 2:1-oversubscribed scale-out fabric.
#
# Used with -nodes 64 -num_gpus_per_node 8: ranks 0..7, 8..15, ... form eight
# scale-up domains, while inter-domain messages traverse this tapered fabric.
# Host links and upward links are both 100 Gbps; tapering is represented by four
# uplinks for each eight-host leaf.  Contiguous rank placement makes Bine's
# locality-aware partner sequence meaningful.
Nodes 64
Tiers 2
Podsize 64

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 4
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 100
Oversubscribed 2

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 100
Radix_Down 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 100
